The ONNX graphs in this folder (flow_lm.onnx, flow_lm_int8.onnx, mimi_encoder.onnx, mimi_decoder.onnx and graphs.json)
are exported by packaging/pocket/export.py from Kyutai's Pocket TTS code (https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts,
pocket_tts 4.0.1) and are under its MIT license below. They hold no weights: the app downloads those from Hugging Face
under their own license (CC-BY-4.0, docs/MODELS.md).

